          "english": "Psychologists have long been in disagreement as to whether competition is a learned or a genetic component of human behavior. Whatever it is, you cannot but recognize the effect competition is exerting in academics and many other areas of contemporary life.",
          "chinese": "长期以来，心理学家一直未能就竞争究竟是人类行为中后天习得的成分还是遗传的成分达成一致。无论它究竟属于哪一种，你都不得不承认，竞争正在对学术以及当代生活的许多其他领域产生影响。",
